14. PUBLIC HEARING regarding board approval for a dog boarding
kennel located on Tract 8, Stearns Subdivision, Laramie County, WY.
25 - 028
Hurbis, Board Approval
Attachments:
Justin Arnold, Planning, said Steil Surveying Services, LLC, on behalf of Louis Hurbis,
submitted a board approval and site plan application for a dog boarding kennel
located at 6912 Christensen Rd.
Arnold said based on evidence provided, staff recommends approval of the dog
boarding kennel with the adoption of findings of fact a and b with no conditions.
